  "type": "page",
  "content": "<a href=\"/\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M257.5 445.1l-22.2 22.2c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0L7 273c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L201.4 44.7c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l22.2 22.2c9.5 9.5 9.3 25-.4 34.3L136.6 216H424c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24v32c0 13.3-10.7 24-24 24H136.6l120.5 114.8c9.8 9.3 10 24.8.4 34.3z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBack\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<p>Project &gt;</p><p>Rumah Kedua</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Rumah Kedua App - UI Design</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p data-path-to-node=\"4\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Project Overview : </b><b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Rumah Kedua</b> (The Second Home) is a strategic digital response to the fragility of conventional social monitoring in protecting today’s youth. It is designed not just as a reporting tool, but as an integrated mental defense ecosystem that bridges the gap between technological speed and human empathy.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"6\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Challenge (The Problem) : </b>Current protection mechanisms are suffering from \"functional paralysis.\" According to Indonesia Education Monitoring Network (JPPI) data, there were <b data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"149\">573 cases of violence in 2024 alone</b>. The core issues include:</p><ul data-path-to-node=\"8\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Systemic Fragility:</b> Slow bureaucracy and limited access leave victims unprotected.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Psychological Safety Gap:</b> A massive fear of social stigma prevents victims of bullying and sexual violence from speaking up.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Trauma Exploitation:</b> Perpetrators exploit these systemic loopholes, leaving victims in prolonged trauma without adequate help.</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node=\"9\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Solution (Design &amp; Logic) : </b>I designed a transformation-driven platform focused on a <b data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"57\">Preventive-Predictive</b> approach to human safety:</p><ul data-path-to-node=\"11\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Integrated Defense Ecosystem:</b> Moving beyond \"passive reporting\" to a system that combines automated urgency with human-centric counseling.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Interconnected Support:</b> A synergy designed to multiply existing support capacities rather than replace them, ensuring faster intervention.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Stigma-Free Interface:</b> A UI/UX focused on privacy and anonymity to break the barriers of fear, ensuring equal access to mental health support.</p></li></ul>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🔗Link</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.figma.com/proto/6hnXPG12qb2eEt7ldIvUft/Rumah-Kedua?node-id=1-8842&#038;starting-point-node-id=1%3A8842\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLive Demo\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"d558856\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"8\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MjE2NCwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNlwvMDFcLzgucG5nIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiZDU1ODg1NiJ9\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/8.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/8.png\" alt=\"8\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"d558856\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"9\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MjE2NSwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNlwvMDFcLzkucG5nIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiZDU1ODg1NiJ9\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/9.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/9.png\" alt=\"9\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"d558856\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"10\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MjE2NiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNlwvMDFcLzEwLnBuZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6ImQ1NTg4NTYifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/10.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/10.png\" alt=\"10\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"d558856\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"11\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MjE2NywidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNlwvMDFcLzExLnBuZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6ImQ1NTg4NTYifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/11.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/11.png\" alt=\"11\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"d558856\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"12\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MjE2OCwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNlwvMDFcLzEyLnBuZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6ImQ1NTg4NTYifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/12.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/12.png\" alt=\"12\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"d558856\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"13\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MjE2OSwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNlwvMDFcLzEzLnBuZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6ImQ1NTg4NTYifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/13.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/13.png\" alt=\"13\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"d558856\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"14\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MjE3MCwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNlwvMDFcLzE0LnBuZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6ImQ1NTg4NTYifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/14.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/14.png\" alt=\"14\" /></figure></a>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M646 125C629 125 613 133 604 142L308 442C296 454 292 471 292 487 292 504 296 521 308 533L604 854C617 867 629 875 646 875 663 875 679 871 692 858 704 846 713 829 713 812 713 796 708 779 692 767L438 487 692 225C700 217 708 204 708 187 708 171 704 154 692 142 675 129 663 125 646 125Z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M696 533C708 521 713 504 713 487 713 471 708 454 696 446L400 146C388 133 375 125 354 125 338 125 325 129 313 142 300 154 292 171 292 187 292 204 296 221 308 233L563 492 304 771C292 783 288 800 288 817 288 833 296 850 308 863 321 871 338 875 354 875 371 875 388 867 400 854L696 533Z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p><b data-path-to-node=\"12,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Result:</b> A high-impact digital innovation that empowers the younger generation to create a safe, sustainable, and violence-free educational environment.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🧩 <strong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"407\">Topic Area</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tMental Health &amp; Safety\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSocial Innovation\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tChild &amp; Youth Protection\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🛠️ <strong data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"961\">Skills Used</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tUser Interface (UI) Design\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tUX Research and User Testing\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tEmpathy-Driven Design\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tUser Experience (UX) Design\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tSystem Architecture\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>⭐ Key Features</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<ul><li data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1175\"><p data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1175\"><strong data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1087\">Skill Matching Engine:</strong> Automatically connects users with ideal partners based on offered and desired skills.</p></li><li data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1278\"><p data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1278\"><strong data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1197\">Profile System:</strong> Each user has a skill portfolio to showcase what they teach and want to learn.</p></li><li data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1380\"><p data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1380\"><strong data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1308\">Built-in Communication:</strong> Seamless chat and video call integration for real-time collaboration.</p></li><li data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1489\"><p data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1489\"><strong data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1411\">Collaborative Ecosystem:</strong> Encourages peer-to-peer learning, community support, and network expansion.</p></li></ul>"
